Z||000001||fierosound||05-06-2000||04:37 PM||||Thanks for the kind words.  IiplayaziI here on the forum is also a Fiero owner in Calgary.  We got to discussing getting other owners together and see how it goes.  It seems there may be about 8-10 people there with their cars on Thursday May 11 around 7:30pm onward.<P>Just a note - this is the first Get-together of CALGARY F.O.G. (Fiero Owner's Group).  All Fiero owners in Calgary are invited to com'on down!!<P>Willy's Hamburgers Drive-In<BR>MacLeod Tr & 39th Ave South<BR>Calgary, Alberta<P>See you there: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/fierosound</A> <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 05-06-2000).]||||reg||14
Z||000002||RiceCooker||05-06-2000||09:42 PM||||I'M in too guys! <BR>Good thing it's Thursday cause Friday + weekend my car is gettin fiero store headers put on it. Manifolds have been gettin steadlily worse so I decided to re-do the entire exhaust. Anyways, you guys have probably seen the two sweet yellow GT's around and I know one by name (the driver, not the car) He knows some more guys and we might just end up filling the entire Parking Lot! <BR>Later!||||reg||6
